---
// v4 retirement notice, shown at the top of the landing page. v4 is frozen
// at v4.3.1 on the release/v4 branch; v5 is the documented line on this site.
---

<aside class="mt-16 border-b border-border bg-bg-secondary/60" role="note" aria-label="v4 retirement notice">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted m-0">
      <span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">cmdguard v4 is retired</span>
      — frozen at <code class="text-xs">v4.3.1</code> on the <code class="text-xs">release/v4</code>
      branch. New projects should use
      <a href="/guides/migrating-v4-to-v5/" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">v5 (migration guide)</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</aside>
